Cell["\<\
For quaternionic representations we also can calculate representation \
matrices of elements from \[DoubleStruckCapitalR] and \
\[DoubleStruckCapitalC]. We also test interesting property of determinant, \
which can serve as definition of matrix representation of Clifford algebra as \
well. All calculations are sorted first by algebras positive, then negative \
signature. \
\>", "Text",
