Cell["\<\
 \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuaternionIsomorphismRules\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\[Rule]True is the same as \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuaternionIsomorphismRules\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]->{\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]HH2R4\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote],\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Pauli[1,2]\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]}, i.e. first apply quaternion product to real \
matrices, then if quaternions still remains replace them by Pauli[1,2] \
matrices\
\>", "Text",
