Cell["\<\
Because here we see quaternion product, we can reduce them to real matrices \
with \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]QuaternionIsomorphismRules\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]\
\[Rule]{\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]HH2R4\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]}\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.673770213170585*^9, 3.673770271212688*^9}, {
   3.673770498050648*^9, 3.673770512428942*^9}, {3.67377085466058*^9, 
   3.673770874134313*^9}, {3.673847424440953*^9, 3.673847454297884*^9}, {
