Cell["\<\
Explicit matrix Hermite conjugation: the function conjugateHermiteConjugat[ ] \
is defined in the beginning of the notebook
Use signs of involution Hermite conjugation and subtract the two results. \
Zero matrices means we are done. \
\>", "Text",
